      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, ive had this annoying heavy feeling in my jaw and neck for like an hour now. nothing in my chest or anything so i dont think it's a big deal, most likely just tension from clenching my teeth at work. u think it's just jaw muscle stuff or something i can just deal with at home? i really dont wanna deal with the hassle of a clinic visit for something minor lol",
